-- Install smb to your local machine
Linux Sample

sudo apt install samba

-- add SharedFiles on smb.conf
sudo nano /etc/samba/smb.conf

under global add:
vfs objects = streams_xattr

for IOS device

at the very end add this
[SharedFiles]
path = /local path
writable = yes
guest ok = no
valid users = your user

save this on your file

Create password

sudo smbpasswd -a userName

then restart smb

sudo systemctl restart smbd